{
  "uid": "quickbank-local",
  "title": "QuickBank",
  "tags": ["quickbank"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "account",
        "label": "Número da conta",
        "type": "textbox",
        "current": { "text": "10000001", "value": "10000001" },
        "options": [{ "text": "10000001", "value": "10000001", "selected": true }],
        "query": "10000001"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Como filtrar",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Isto é Grafana local, não a interface de um tenant Dynatrace. Os spans vêm do collector (os mesmos que o Jaeger em :16686 recebe). Os logs são o stdout do processo `app`.\n\nCole no Explore. Troque o número da conta no campo acima ou no texto.\n\n**Número da conta** (Tempo): `{ span.account.number = \"$account\" }`\n\n**Depósito** (Tempo): `{ span.movement.type = \"DEPOSIT\" }`\n\n**Transferência** (Tempo): `{ name = \"quickbank.ledger.transfer\" }`\n\n**Mock de pagamento** (Tempo): `{ name = \"quickbank.payment.mock\" && span.mock = \"true\" }`\n\n**Erros** (Tempo): `{ status = error }`\n\n**Logs** (Loki), mesma ordem: `{service=\"app\"} |= \"$account\"` · `{service=\"app\"} |~ \"DEPOSIT|MOCK payment\"` · `{service=\"app\"} |~ \"TRANSFER|transfer\"` · `{service=\"app\"} |= \"MOCK payment\"` · `{service=\"app\"} |~ \"ERROR|Exception|insufficient-funds|account-exists|idempotency-conflict\"`"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Spans da conta",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "datasource": { "type": "tempo", "uid": "tempo" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "tempo", "uid": "tempo" },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{ span.account.number = \"$account\" }",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Logs da conta",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 6 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "options": { "showTime": true, "showLabels": false, "wrapLogMessage": true, "dedupStrategy": "none", "sortOrder": "Descending", "enableLogDetails": true },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "expr": "{service=\"app\"} |= \"$account\"" }]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Depósito",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "datasource": { "type": "tempo", "uid": "tempo" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "tempo", "uid": "tempo" },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{ span.movement.type = \"DEPOSIT\" }",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Transferência",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 14 },
      "datasource": { "type": "tempo", "uid": "tempo" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "tempo", "uid": "tempo" },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{ name = \"quickbank.ledger.transfer\" }",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Mock de pagamento",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 22 },
      "datasource": { "type": "tempo", "uid": "tempo" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "tempo", "uid": "tempo" },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{ name = \"quickbank.payment.mock\" && span.mock = \"true\" }",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Logs do mock de pagamento",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 22 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "options": { "showTime": true, "showLabels": false, "wrapLogMessage": true, "dedupStrategy": "none", "sortOrder": "Descending", "enableLogDetails": true },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "expr": "{service=\"app\"} |= \"MOCK payment\"" }]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Erros",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 30 },
      "datasource": { "type": "tempo", "uid": "tempo" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "tempo", "uid": "tempo" },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{ status = error }",
          "limit": 20,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Logs de erro",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 30 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "options": { "showTime": true, "showLabels": false, "wrapLogMessage": true, "dedupStrategy": "none", "sortOrder": "Descending", "enableLogDetails": true },
      "targets": [{ "refId": "A", "expr": "{service=\"app\"} |~ \"ERROR|Exception|insufficient-funds|account-exists|idempotency-conflict\"" }]
    }
  ]
}
